{"slug":"w-k-l","ar":"و ك ل","total":70,"core":"trust; reliance; entrusting","forms":[{"ar":"تَوَكَّلْ","kind":"verb","form":5,"count":40,"gloss":"to put trust, rely","word":null,"ex":{"s":26,"a":217,"p":1,"ar":["وَتَوَكَّلْ","عَلَى","ٱلْعَزِيزِ","ٱلرَّحِيمِ"],"en":"And rely upon the Exalted in Might, the Merciful"}},{"ar":"وَكِيل","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":24,"gloss":"The Trustee, Disposer of affairs","word":"al-wakil","ex":{"s":33,"a":3,"p":6,"ar":["وَتَوَكَّلْ","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ ۚ","وَكَفَىٰ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَكِيلًا"],"en":"And rely upon Allah; and sufficient is Allah as Disposer of affairs"}},{"ar":"مُتَوَكِّلُون","kind":"active participle","form":5,"count":4,"gloss":"One who trusts in Allah","word":"48","ex":{"s":14,"a":12,"p":17,"ar":["وَمَا","لَنَآ","أَلَّا","نَتَوَكَّلَ","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","وَقَدْ","هَدَىٰنَا","سُبُلَنَا ۚ","وَلَنَصْبِرَنَّ","عَلَىٰ","مَآ","ءَاذَيْتُمُونَا ۚ","وَعَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","فَلْيَتَوَكَّلِ","ٱلْمُتَوَكِّلُونَ"],"en":"And why should we not rely upon Allah while He has guided us to our [good] ways. And we will surely be patient against whatever harm you should cause us. And upon Allah let those who would rely [indeed] rely"}},{"ar":"وُكِّلَ","kind":"verb","form":2,"count":2,"gloss":"to put in charge, entrust","word":null,"ex":{"s":32,"a":11,"p":6,"ar":["قُلْ","يَتَوَفَّىٰكُم","مَّلَكُ","ٱلْمَوْتِ","ٱلَّذِى","وُكِّلَ","بِكُمْ","ثُمَّ","إِلَىٰ","رَبِّكُمْ","تُرْجَعُونَ"],"en":"Say, \"The angel of death will take you who has been entrusted with you. Then to your Lord you will be returned"}}],"surahs":[[3,5],[4,5],[17,5],[6,4],[10,4],[11,4],[12,4],[14,4],[33,4],[39,4],[8,3],[42,3],[5,2],[9,2],[16,2],[25,2],[7,1],[13,1],[26,1],[27,1],[28,1],[29,1],[32,1],[58,1],[60,1],[64,1],[65,1],[67,1],[73,1]]}